# Curated phong-mcp gateway (replaces phong-mcp-rust). Build context: services/ai-proxy
# Layout mirrors the repo so the src/academic symlink (-> ../../academic-search-mcp/src/academic) resolves.
FROM node:22-bookworm-slim
WORKDIR /srv
RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends curl ca-certificates && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
# Shared deps live in /srv/node_modules so both phong-mcp/ and academic-search-mcp/ resolve them.
RUN printf '{"name":"phong-mcp-gateway-deps","private":true,"type":"module","dependencies":{"@modelcontextprotocol/sdk":"1.29.0","undici":"6.25.0","turndown":"7.2.4","zod":"3.25.76"}}' > package.json \
 && npm install --omit=dev --no-audit --no-fund
COPY academic-search-mcp/src /srv/academic-search-mcp/src
COPY phong-mcp/src /srv/phong-mcp/src
WORKDIR /srv/phong-mcp
ENV NODE_ENV=production TRANSPORT=http PORT=8775
EXPOSE 8775
HEALTHCHECK --interval=30s --timeout=5s --start-period=15s --retries=3 CMD ["curl", "-sf", "http://127.0.0.1:8775/phong-mcp/health"]
CMD ["node", "src/entries/gateway.ts"]
